# The image needs only the dependency files and the code of the service.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!youtube_automanager/
# Docker already includes the catalogs through the line above, but the linter droast (DF077) needs this line.
!youtube_automanager/i18n/locale/
# The image compiles the code and the catalogs itself, so the bytecode and a .mo file of the host stay out.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.mo
